WEBVTT

00:02:56.663 --> 00:03:00.329
Presenečeni boste nad tem, 
kako svež zrak deluje na sveže razmišljanje,

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:01.913
in ko boste to storili,

00:03:01.913 --> 00:03:05.454
boste v življenje prinesli popolnoma nove ideje.

00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:07.163
Hvala.

00:03:07.163 --> 00:03:11.413
(Aplavz)